COPYRIGHT NOTICE AND LIMITED PERSONAL USE TERMS

Project: The Chancery — a Dúnedain Royal Archive
Description: A data-driven chronicle of Tolkien's legendarium — 171 rulers across 8
royal lines (Númenor, Arnor, Arthedain, the Chieftains, Gondor, the Ruling Stewards,
Dol Amroth, and Rohan), with an interactive dashboard, narrative chronicles, and an
analysis notebook tracing every date to its source.
